        "checked_at": "2026-10-18",
        "excerpt": "Sonia Sotomayor, Associate Justice, was born in Bronx, New York, on June 25, 1954. She earned a B.A. in 1976 from Princeton University. In 1979, she earned a J.D. from Yale Law School. At Pavia & Harcourt, she served as an associate and then partner from 1984–1992. She assumed this role August 8, 2009.",
